<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Breed Tech cut from list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Breed Tech cut from list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities has dropped Breed Technologies Inc from its select list of stocks, but it remains on its single best idea list, a Prudential source said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the automobile trim company opened off 1-7/8 to 25-3/8 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
